<title>नेपाली साहित्य | AAYUSH</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;
 font-family:"Noto Sans Devanagari",Arial,sans-serif;
 background:#f4f6fb;
 color:#222;
}
header{
 background:linear-gradient(120deg,#14213d,#3155a4);
 color:white;
